    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-formula-card\"><header><h3>geographic-distribution</h3><span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--derived\" data-provenance=\"derived\">curated formula</span></header><div><pre class=\"lens-tex\">\\begin{aligned}\n\\term{meanCenters}{M}&amp;=\\frac{\\sum_i w_i p_i}{\\term{total}{W}},\n&amp;\\term{standardDistances}{SD}&amp;=\\term{multiplier}{k}\\sqrt{\\term{varianceX}{S_{xx}}+\\term{varianceY}{S_{yy}}}\\\\\n\\term{halfSum}{h}&amp;=\\tfrac{1}{2}(S_{xx}+S_{yy}),\n&amp;\\term{halfDifference}{d}&amp;=\\tfrac{1}{2}(S_{xx}-S_{yy}),\n&amp;\\term{radius}{\\rho}&amp;=\\sqrt{d^2+\\term{covariance}{S_{xy}}^2}\\\\\n\\term{ellipses}{(\\sigma_x,\\sigma_y)}&amp;=\\term{scale}{k\\,c}\\left(\\sqrt{h-\\rho},\\ \\sqrt{h+\\rho}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}</pre><p class=\"lens-ascii\">M = sum w p / W; Sxx, Syy, Sxy = weighted second moments about M divided by W (not W - 1); SD = k sqrt(Sxx + Syy); h = (Sxx + Syy)/2; d = (Sxx - Syy)/2; rho = sqrt(d^2 + Sxy^2); ellipse semi-axes (sigmaX, sigmaY) = k c (sqrt(h - rho), sqrt(h + rho)) with c = sqrt(2) for the arcgis convention and 1 for standard; k = standardDeviations. Planar coordinates only; rows with a non-finite position or a non-positive weight are excluded.</p></div><div class=\"lens-symbols\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographic-distribution-compiled:geographic-distribution-publish\" data-value=\"meanCenters\">meanCenters · output · meanCentersOut</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographic-distribution-compiled:geographic-distribution-mean\" data-value=\"total\">weight sum · intermediate · total</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.g